 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Timestamps strictly increase across calls. Amounts are positive integers. Levels 1-3 as variant 3. mergeAccounts(ts,a,b) folds b into a (balance, outgoing, pending cashbacks and payment ownership) and removes b; false if a==b or either is missing. A removed id may be created again as a new account. getBalance(ts,id,timeAt) returns the balance id had at time timeAt (after all events and cashbacks at or before timeAt), or -1 if no account with that id existed then.",
  "provenance": [
